This repo is the Stephan site: assessment and management of psychosocial risks at work. Public copy is Portuguese, with an English toggle. Do not invent the partners' names.

Frontend calls the API only through `ApiService` and `environment.apiUrl`. Production uses the Netlify `/api/v1` proxy. `/studio` stays off the public nav. Studio issues must not receive the `solve` label automatically.
